<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan starts 2 cellular cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan starts 2 cellular cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analyst Kurt Abkemeier initiated coverage of two cellular telecommunications companies.</p>
<p>-- rated Omnipoint Corp, with a $25 year-end 1998 price target.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 5/16 to 14-5/16.</p>
<p>-- started Western Wireless Corp with a long-term buy, and a year-end price target of $21.</p>
<p>-- stock was flat at 14-1/2.</p>
</text>
